            "feature_2_title": "\"Never counting minutes to take them off again\"",
            "feature_2_description": "You know that end-of-day feeling when you get home and the first thing you do is take off your uncomfortable jeans? With these you forget about them. 98% cotton = sweatpant comfort, jeans look.",
