            "heading_part_one": "The 2-Second Transformation",
            "heading_part_two": "",
            "bullet_list": "The 2-Second Transformation\nBefore: Flat butt, gap in waist → After: Instant lift, natural curves\n\nInstant lift, perfect round shape.\n\nIt’s not magic, it’s 98% premium cotton with 2% Spandex that adapts to your body and supports you where needed. In 2 seconds you go from \"meh\" to \"wow\".\n\nForget about:\n\nStiff jeans that flatten you all day\nThe gap in the waist that drives you crazy\nPulling up your pants every 5 minutes\nWide leg that makes you look shapeless",
            "closing_line": "With BBL Jeans: Move freely without losing shape Zero gap, perfect fit Wear them 12+ hours without suffering Follow the wide leg trend without sacrificing curves",
            "heading_size": 28,
            "text_size": 14,
            "heading_color_one": "#3b2f2a",
