            "bullet_list": "From petite to curvy. Office worker to athlete. Comfort seeker to curve lover.\n\nThese jeans were made for YOUR body, not some \"average woman\" that doesn’t exist.\n\nWhat’s included:\n\nRegular Fit true-to-size\nMid-low rise that flatters\nButton, zipper and functional pockets\n2 colors: Light Blue & Dark Blue",
            "closing_line": "Real talk:\"When your butt is properly supported, everything changes. You feel confident, powerful, ready for anything.\" - verified customer",
