        "ai_gen_block_41479e3_yyzcqt": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_41479e3",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "heading_size": 28,
            "desktop_cards": "5",
            "mobile_cards": "1.2",
            "card_background": "#ffffff",
            "border_color": "#ececec",
            "corner_radius": 14,
            "star_color": "#c9a26d",
            "show_arrows": true,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "review_1_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-bbl-rev-sarah.webp",
            "review_1_name": "Sarah G.",
            "review_1_rating": "5",
            "review_1_title": "",
            "review_1_text": "After years of searching for the perfect jeans, I had basically given up. Either they were comfortable but flattened me, or they made me look good but after 2 hours I wanted to die. These are like 2 in 1: they flatter like push-up jeans but are comfortable like sweatpants. My boyfriend asked me \"did you do something different today?\" GIRLS. HE NOTICED. They fit true to size.",
            "review_2_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-bbl-rev-julia.webp",
            "review_2_name": "Julia F.",
            "review_2_rating": "5",
            "review_2_title": "",
            "review_2_text": "Ok guys I have to be honest. I bought them only because I was tired of jeans that flattened my butt. I didn’t expect them to give me such an amazing BBL effect too lol 😂 They’re stretchy but look like real jeans, not leggings. You touch them and feel real cotton. And the best part? ZERO gap in the waist. Finally! Only \"problem\": now I don’t want to wear my old jeans anymore haha. I got both Light Blue and Dark Blue.",
            "review_3_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-bbl-forallwomen-v2.webp",
            "review_3_name": "Sophie O.",
            "review_3_rating": "5",
            "review_3_title": "",
            "review_3_text": "Girlsss, I was SO TIRED of having to take all my jeans to the tailor because the waist was always too loose in the back. With these they fit perfect right out of the box. Zero alterations needed. Oh and they’re super stretchy thanks to the Spandex, like I can do squats no problem. Get your normal size!",
            "review_4_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-bbl-rev-emma.jpg",
            "review_4_name": "Emma B.",
            "review_4_rating": "5",
            "review_4_title": "",
            "review_4_text": "This was what stressed me most about regular jeans... every time I sat down or bent over there was that embarrassing empty space in the waist 💀 With these ZERO problems. I tested them like every way possible (yes, I even took mirror pics from all angles lol) and they fit PERFECTLY. And girls, they’re super comfortable. The cotton is so soft.",
            "review_5_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-bbl-rev-claire-v2.webp",
            "review_5_name": "Claire H.",
            "review_5_rating": "5",
            "review_5_title": "5 stars · Smooth back",
            "review_5_text": "I was always afraid of wide leg jeans because they made me look flat and shapeless. These are like magic: super trendy wide leg but they hug the butt perfectly. I got like 5 compliments the first time I wore them. Dark Blue is perfect for evenings, Light Blue for daytime."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
